---
const repo = 'https://github.com/weekdayjast/MiracastReceiver';
const protocols = [
 ['01', 'AirPlay', '从 iPhone 到大屏。', '通过 iPhone、iPad 或 Mac 发起屏幕镜像，或投送视频和音频。', 'Apple 设备'],
 ['02', 'DLNA', '好内容，一点即播。', '在兼容的视频 App 中选择电视，支持 Bilibili、优酷、爱奇艺及 Emby 等来源。', '手机 · 媒体服务器'],
 ['03', 'Miracast', '给电脑，多一块屏幕。', 'Windows 使用 Win + K，兼容的安卓手机使用系统投屏。部分电视需要 root 配置。', 'Windows · Android'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Miracast Receiver：开源 Android TV 投屏接收端，支持 AirPlay、DLNA 与 Miracast。查看兼容范围、下载安装与使用指南。"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#101815"/><title>Miracast Receiver — 把大屏，还给内容。</title></head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
<header><a class="brand" href="#">▣ <span>Miracast Receiver</span></a><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#features">功能</a><a href="#compatibility">兼容性</a><a href="#install">安装指南</a><a href={repo}>GitHub ↗</a></nav><a class="nav-download" href={`${repo}/releases/latest`}>下载 APK ↗</a></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> OPEN SOURCE · ANDROID TV</div><h1>把大屏，<br/>还给<span>内容。</span></h1><p class="lead">手机里的精彩，电脑上的灵感。<br/>用一个开源接收端，连接你和电视。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`${repo}/releases/latest`}>下载 Android TV 版 <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#install">看看如何开始 ↓</a></div><p class="subtle">免费开源 / MIT 许可 / Android 5.0+</p><div class="product"><div class="product-bar"><span>● ● ●</span><span>YOUR SCREEN. YOUR CHOICE.</span><span>01 / RECEIVER</span></div><img src="/images/home.png" alt="Miracast Receiver 电视端首页实际界面，展示设备名称和投屏服务" width="1920" height="1080"/><div class="caption">真实应用界面 <span>装在电视上 · 从你的设备发起投屏</span></div></div></section>
<section id="features" class="features"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ONE RECEIVER. MORE POSSIBILITIES.</p><h2>设备不同，<br/>大屏的快乐相同。</h2><p>从系统镜像到视频投送，选择适合你的连接方式。</p></div><div class="protocols">{protocols.map(([num,name,title,description,label]) => <article><div class="number">{num} / {label}</div><h3>{name}</h3><h4>{title}</h4><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="statement"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR YOUR LIVING ROOM</p><h2>少一点折腾。<br/>多一点<span>自在。</span></h2><div><p>支持 HTTP / HTTPS 视频流、HLS 直播与图片播放。可开启开机自动启动接收服务，让电视随时准备接收下一段精彩。</p><a class="text-link" href={repo}>查看开源项目 ↗</a></div></section>
<section id="compatibility"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR CONNECTION</p><h2>先选设备，再选方式。</h2><p>实际体验取决于发送端、电视硬件与网络环境。</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>你的设备 / 来源</th><th>推荐方式</th><th>使用前了解</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>iPhone / iPad / Mac</td><td>AirPlay</td><td>镜像、视频及音频投送；具体 App 兼容性可能不同</td></tr><tr><td>视频 App / Emby / Plex</td><td>DLNA</td><td>在支持 DLNA 的 App 中选择接收设备</td></tr><tr><td>Windows / Android 系统投屏</td><td>Miracast</td><td>需要兼容的硬件；部分电视需要 root</td></tr><tr><td>Google Cast / 华为 Cast+</td><td>实验性支持</td><td>能力和机型有限，请先阅读项目文档</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="note">Google Cast 仅支持 Default Media Receiver，不支持 YouTube 专用协议或屏幕镜像。华为 Cast+ 需在设置中启用。</p></section>
<section id="install" class="install"><div><p class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</p><h2>三步，把精彩<br/>放大。</h2><a class="button" href={`${repo}/releases/latest`}>前往下载页面 ↗</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>下载适合电视的 APK</h3><p>现代设备通常选择 ARM64，老旧设备可查看 ARM32 版本。以发布页提供的文件为准。</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>安装到 Android TV</h3><p>将 APK 复制到 U 盘，在电视文件管理器中打开安装；也可通过 ADB 安装。</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>连接同一网络，开始投屏</h3><p>打开电视端应用，在手机或电脑的投屏列表中选择电视显示的设备名称。Miracast 的配置要求请参阅文档。</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section class="faq"><h2>开始之前，你可能想问。</h2><details><summary>为什么找不到电视？</summary><p>先确认应用已启动、设备处于同一局域网，且路由器没有启用客户端隔离。Miracast 使用 Wi-Fi Direct，还需要电视与发送端支持相应能力。</p></details><details><summary>所有功能都需要 root 吗？</summary><p>AirPlay 和 DLNA 不以 root 为前提。Miracast 在部分电视上需要额外 root 配置，请查看仓库的 Windows 无线投屏说明。</p></details><details><summary>遇到兼容问题怎么办？</summary><p>请记录电视型号、Android 版本、发送端 App 和问题步骤，前往 <a href={`${repo}/issues`}>GitHub Issues</a> 反馈。实验性功能请先查阅仓库文档。</p></details></section>
</main><footer><a class="brand" href="#">▣ Miracast Receiver</a><p>让你的电视，接住每一份精彩。</p><a href={repo}>开源于 GitHub ↗</a><span>MIT LICENSE</span></footer>
</body></html>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:Inter,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#17261e;background:#f5f6f1;font-synthesis:none;scroll-behavior:smooth}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #2d7656;outline-offset:6px}header{height:88px;max-width:1280px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid #d9dfd7}.brand{font-weight:700;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}nav{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:14px}.nav-download{font-size:13px;border:1px solid #bcc8be;border-radius:30px;padding:11px 18px}main>section{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:100px 40px;scroll-margin-top:30px}.hero{text-align:center;padding-top:76px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;color:#557461}.eyebrow span{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#3b8c61;margin-right:8px}h1{font-size:clamp(64px,8vw,108px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-5px;margin:30px 0}h1 span,.statement h2 span{color:#558367}.lead{font-size:19px;line-height:1.9;color:#637167}.actions{display:flex;gap:28px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin:30px 0 18px}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:30px;background:#244b36;color:#fff;padding:17px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px}.button:hover{background:#34684c}.text-link{font-size:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #a6b6a8;padding-bottom:5px}.subtle{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#738075}.product{margin-top:65px;padding:12px;background:#15241c;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 35px 65px #18301b22;text-align:left}.product-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;padding:12px 12px 20px;color:#9eafa1}.product img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px}.caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#bbcabd;font-size:11px;padding:18px 10px 6px}.section-heading h2,h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0}.section-heading>p:last-child{color:#6b786e;line-height:1.8}.protocols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:55px;border-top:1px solid #ccd6cb}.protocols article{padding:30px 28px 0 0}.protocols article+article{border-left:1px solid #d8dfd5;padding-left:28px}.number{font-size:11px;color:#728270}.protocols h3{font-size:32px;font-weight:500;margin:36px 0 25px}.protocols h4{font-size:18px;font-weight:500}.protocols p,.statement p,.install p,.faq p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#66766a}.statement{background:#e5ebe1;border-radius:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 70px}.statement>.eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}.statement>div{align-self:end;padding-bottom:12px}.table-wrap{overflow:auto;margin-top:44px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:14px}td,th{padding:22px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6ded3;line-height:1.6}th{color:#778675;font-size:11px;font-weight:500}td:last-child{color:#6b796e}.note{font-size:12px;color:#72816f;line-height:1.8;margin-top:22px}.install{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;border-top:1px solid #d6ded3}.install .button{margin-top:20px}ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}li{display:flex;gap:25px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d6ded3}li>span{font-size:12px;color:#708570;padding-top:5px}li h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:500;margin:0}li p{margin-bottom:0}.faq{padding-top:20px}.faq h2{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:35px}details{border-bottom:1px solid #d6ded3;padding:24px 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:16px}details p{max-width:800px}details a{text-decoration:underline}footer{border-top:1px solid #d6ded3;max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:45px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7b6c}footer p{flex:1}footer span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px}.skip{position:absolute;top:-60px;left:15px;background:white;padding:12px}.skip:focus{top:10px}@media(max-width:760px){header{padding:0 20px;height:72px}.brand{font-size:13px}nav{display:none}.nav-download{font-size:11px}main>section{padding:65px 22px}h1{letter-spacing:-3px}.lead{font-size:16px}.actions{gap:18px}.button{font-size:12px;gap:12px}.product{margin-top:45px;padding:7px}.product-bar{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:0}.caption span{display:none}.protocols{grid-template-columns:1fr}.protocols article,.protocols article+article{border-left:0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dfd5;padding:26px 0}.protocols h3{margin:20px 0}.statement,.install{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.statement{border-radius:0}td,th{min-width:135px;font-size:12px}td:last-child{min-width:220px}footer{padding:35px 22px;flex-wrap:wrap}footer p{flex-basis:100%;order:3}.subtle{font-size:10px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:root{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
